PARAM POINT_ID input2
PARAM POINT_ID input3
PARAM POINT_ID output7

; Reusable Stage 11 edge-trigger example.
; Bind input2/input3/output7 to the real PointState-backed BOOL points at load time.
; If both edges are seen in the same scan, the falling-edge branch runs last and output7 ends false.

R_TRIG input2
JZ check_falling_edge
PUSH_TRUE
STORE_BOOL output7

check_falling_edge:
F_TRIG input3
JZ done
PUSH_FALSE
STORE_BOOL output7

done:
HALT